## Separate build and Lakehouse query warehouses

Context: Lakehouse//RT accepts read queries only and rejects the `CREATE VIEW`,
CTAS, and write statements used by Knowledge Graph builds. Build SQL was
incorrectly routed through the Lakehouse query warehouse after enabling the
Statement Execution API, causing builds to fail with
`UNSUPPORTED_FEATURE.CREATE_VIEW`.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/helpers/DatabricksHelpers.py
   Added dedicated build warehouse and transport resolution, and prevented
   build credentials from falling back to the Lakehouse query warehouse.
2. src/back/objects/session/GlobalConfigService.py
   Persisted the build Statement Execution API setting independently from the
   Lakehouse query transport.
3. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py
   Added build warehouse persistence and rejected Lakehouse//RT as build
   compute.
4. src/api/routers/internal/settings.py
   Added the endpoint used to save the dedicated build warehouse settings.
5. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/_build_pipeline.py
   Routed the general Knowledge Graph build client through the build transport.
6. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaTripleStoreBuildPipeline.py
   Routed the Databricks-only build client through the build transport.
7. src/back/core/databricks/SQLWarehouse.py
   Exposed warehouse types to Settings and mapped RT DDL failures to actionable
   Build SQL Warehouse guidance.
8. src/front/templates/settings.html
   Separated Build SQL Warehouse and Query SQL Warehouse responsibilities in
   the Settings UI.
9. src/front/static/config/js/settings.js
   Persisted the build transport independently and disabled RT warehouses in
   the build selector.
10. docs/architecture.md, docs/deployment.md, docs/get-started.md
    Documented the build/query warehouse split and RT read-only limitation.
11. tests/units/settings/test_delta_warehouse_config.py,
    tests/back/core/digitaltwin/test_build_pipeline_units.py,
    tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_build_pipeline.py,
    tests/units/core/test_sql_warehouse.py, tests/units/api/test_ui_rendering.py
    Added regression coverage for persistence, routing, validation, diagnostics,
    and Settings markup.
12. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-10-build-query-warehouse-split-design.md,
    docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-10-build-query-warehouse-split.md
    Recorded the approved design and implementation sequence.

